Package: epiworldRcalibrate
Type: Package
Title: Generic Calibration Interface for Agent-Based Epidemic Models
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: person("Sima", "Najafzadeh", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "sima@example.com")
Description: Provides a three-step generic workflow for epidemic-model calibration: simulation or data import, calibrator training, and evaluation/comparison. Includes epiworldR SIR/SEIR adapters, user-supplied data and simulator interfaces, a generic BiLSTM calibrator, and ABC/optimization benchmark methods.
